<h2 class="bde-heading-506-115 bde-heading">
How Much Is Kawhi Leonard’s Salary at the Raptors?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-116 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-139 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-151 bde-f-text">
<p>Leonard earns <strong>$50.3m</strong> in 2026-27, the largest salary on the <a href="/teams/toronto-raptors/">Raptors</a> payroll after the Clippers traded him to Toronto in September. It is the last year of the extension he signed with the Clippers, and up from <strong>$50m</strong> last season.</p>
<p>His career earnings reach <strong>$428.6m</strong> across sixteen seasons. The salary is <strong>25.00%</strong> of the club’s <strong>$201.19m</strong> payroll.</p>

