<h3>What’s Next for Kawhi Leonard Beyond 2026?</h3><p>His Clippers contract ends this season, and his two-year Toronto extension takes over in 2027-28 at about <strong>$56.1m</strong>, rising to about <strong>$58.9m</strong> in 2028-29. That second year is a player option, so he could become a free agent in 2028 at 37.</p><script src="/_ported/8334868131c3.js" is:inline></script>
