</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-118 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-141 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-154 bde-f-text">
<p>Leonard signed a two-year extension with Toronto worth <strong>$115m</strong> on September 22, 2026, a week after the trade. It covers 2027-28 and 2028-29, with a player option in the second year, and is about <strong>$11.1m</strong> below the maximum he could have signed for.</p>
<p>This season he is paid under the three-year maximum extension worth <strong>$149.51m</strong> that he signed with the Clippers in January 2024, and he waived its 15% trade bonus so the trade could go through. He can become an unrestricted free agent in 2028 at 37 if he declines the option, or in 2029 at 38.</p>

