</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Published estimates put Leonard’s net worth at around <strong>$160m</strong>, against <strong>$428.6m</strong> in career earnings. His endorsement income has been substantial for most of the last decade.</p>
<p><a href="/teams/indiana-pacers/">Indiana</a> drafted him 15th in 2011 out of San Diego State and traded him to <a href="/teams/san-antonio-spurs/">San Antonio</a> on draft night. He was 20, and the first contract he signed paid <strong>$8.32m</strong> across four years.</p>

